layout: default
title: Why freediving
---

<div class="page mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
  <header class="mb-16 grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_390px] lg:gap-14">
    <h1 class="page-title mb-0 mt-0">Freediving gives you your life back.</h1>
    <div class="w-full max-w-[390px] min-h-[28rem]">
      <blockquote class="instagram-media" data-instgrm-permalink="https://www.instagram.com/p/DbiFJKNTMVc/" data-instgrm-version="14"></blockquote>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="max-w-4xl">
    <div class="mb-14">
      <p class="page-display mb-3 mt-0 text-3xl sm:text-5xl">The whole underwater world is in the first ten metres.</p>
      <p class="page-prose mb-0">Out over open water, below that, there is nothing left to look at. So you look inward.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-14">
      <p class="page-display mb-3 mt-0 text-3xl sm:text-5xl">Everything shows up at once.</p>
      <p class="page-prose mb-0">You hold your breath and go under, and every thought you have comes down with you. You start letting them go, one at a time.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-14">
      <p class="page-display mb-3 mt-0 text-3xl sm:text-5xl">Then there is room for you.</p>
      <p class="page-prose mb-0">At first your mind fights back. On the way down it shouts: get out, we are drowning. Calm it down and it goes quiet. That quiet comes up with you, and it is still there at&nbsp;3&nbsp;a.m.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="mt-20 grid gap-12 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-16">
    <section>
      <h2 class="page-display mb-4 mt-0 text-3xl sm:text-4xl">Deeper means calmer.</h2>
      <p class="page-prose">Equalise early, turn at the depth you planned, and come up with air to spare.</p>
      <p class="page-prose mb-0">I certify Molchanovs Wave 1 and Wave 2. Always train with a qualified buddy watching and stay well within your limits.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="page-display mb-4 mt-0 text-3xl sm:text-4xl">One-on-one for kids.</h2>
      <p class="page-prose mb-0">An instructor stays beside your child the whole time, and each skill is solid before the next one starts. <a href="/junior/" class="font-bold decoration-sky-200 decoration-8">Freediving for kids</a></p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <a href="https://instagram.com/nofinsfreediving" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn mt-16">Let&rsquo;s freedive</a>
</div>

